     A                                  6 14'Type in NEWS Item and Press "ENTER-
     A                                      " key to Add Record.'
     A                                  8  1'      NOTE:  NEWS Items Will Displ-
     A                                      ay in Reverse of the Order in Which-
     A                                       they     '
     A                                  9 14'are Entered; ie: Most Recent Items'
     A                                  9 49'Added Will Display First.      '
     A                                 11  1'      Any NEWS Item may be entered'
     A                                 11 36'in the 10 lines available per page-
     A                                      .'
     A                                 12  1'      If the DISTRIBUTION CODE is'
     A                                 12 35'left blank, all MMIS users will re-
     A                                      cieve      '
     A                                 13  1'      the item when they request N-
     A                                      EWS from their session.  If an exis-
     A                                      ting      '
     A                                 14  1'      DISTRIBUTION CODE is entered-
     A                                      , only members already designated'
     A                                 14 69'in'
     A                                 15  1'      that Distribution List will'
     A                                 15 35'receive the NEWS Item.  If a CODE'
     A                                 15 69'is'
     A                                 16  1'      entered which does not exist-
     A                                      , the program will allow the user'
     A                                 16 69'to'
     A                                 17  1'      build a new Distribution Lis-
     A                                      t for that CODE.'
