     A                                  7 30'DISTRIBUTION LISTS'
     A                                  9  1'    Distribution Lists may be used'
     A                                  9 36'to transmit NEWS items to a pre-se-
     A                                      lected    '
     A                                 10  1'    group of users of the MMIS Bul-
     A                                      letin Board.  Specific NEWS items'
     A                                 10 69'may be     '
     A                                 11  1'    sent to groups of users based'
     A                                 11 35'on the data entered in their Perso-
     A                                      nnel File  '
     A                                 12  1'    record.  Distribution lists ar-
     A                                      e named with a six character field'
     A                                 12 70'selected  '
     A                                 13  1'    by the creater and called the'
     A                                 13 35'Distribution Code.  Lists may be a-
     A                                      ddressed   '
     A                                 14  1'    to specific groups of Clock-Ca-
     A                                      rd numbers; all Clock-Card numbers'
     A                                 14 70'assigned  '
     A                                 15  1'    to a given Zone or Zones; all'
     A                                 15 35'members of one or more given Craft-
     A                                      (s); or    '
     A                                 16  1'    all members of given Craft(s)'
     A                                 16 35'assigned to a given Zone or Zones.'
     A                                 17  1'    Distribution Lists may be crea-
     A                                      ted and saved for future use, may'
     A                                 17 69'be changed '
     A                                 18  1'    at any time, or may be deleted'
     A                                 18 36'through the Distribution List Main-
     A                                      tenance   '
     A                                 19  1'    program, "f6" of the main menu-
     A                                      .  The "f2" key of this program wil-
     A                                      l also    '
     A                                 20  1'    list all Distribution Codes an-
     A                                      d allow each list to be displayed.'
